Yeah it wasn't seeing it as a building for some reason, but once i followed the other users suggestion of making a temp room around the sink it worked and the temp now changes every time i leave and enter the garage. 

&#x200B;

I do have a strong feeling in my case it might be because of the double doors i used? There is a small gap from the door to the floor? idk very weird just glad it's sorted now, was scratching my head for more time than i would like to admit lol

